"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep1/quest_story/11231060.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11231060","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11231060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1123106001:1":{"text":"うるさいぞ！ほしい物があるなら持っていけ！余命幾ばくもない老人の邪魔をするな。","source_cn":"吵死了！想拿什么就拿吧！何必打扰我这将死的老人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42C2B7775C1C5C3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123106002:1":{"text":"ちゃんと聞こえてるじゃないですか！……って、ロンロンたちは強盗じゃないですよ！","source_cn":"什么！原来你听得见！啊！不对，我们才不是强盗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0C227A3E76ADAA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123106003:1":{"text":"どうだろうな。\nまあ、たとえ何か奪うつもりでも、もうわしに失うものなどないがな！","source_cn":"强盗，哼。\\n就算你们想抢，对于我来说也没有什么真正能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3BBC6D94A6EB88E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1123106003":{"text":"どうだろうな。\nまあ、たとえ何か奪うつもりでも、もうわしに失うものなどないがな！","source_cn":"强盗，哼。\\n就算你们想抢，对于我来说也没有什么真正能失去的了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3BBC6D94A6EB88E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1123106004:1":{"text":"クルーガーもブラックロアーも知らん。わしはもうとっくにブラックロアーの者ではないのじゃ。","source_cn":"克鲁格与我有什么关系？即便他现在是族长，我也早就不是黑...","status":"matched","hash_